From ff0405700eac2a35bf20aca943477f955f4268e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Dec 2024 12:34:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-210370] emb cmn: collected common fit verify and error code

Separated the existing lib/preboot/fit.c into fit_verify.c,
fit_error.c, security.c. So, that zephyr-plugins can also
use this code to verify the fit loaded at agent stage.

Change-Id: Icb250ca203e8d278b2fef6e52472d45a616b6b1b
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
---

